      "side": 1,
      "message": "[error] Line 932: 🔴 For NVENC in CRF_CONSTRAINED mode this skips setting `bufsize`, while `initAccel()` only adds `rc\u003dvbr` and `cq`. FFmpeg NVENC VBR with `maxrate` but no VBV buffer can ignore or poorly enforce the rate cap, which undermines congestion-control bitrate changes. Keep a sane `bufsize` for NVENC too, or explicitly set the NVENC equivalent validated for this encoder.",
      "revId": "80ed001ed77cf5cf771d621c24b90f98ac74b257",
      "serverId": "1e26b4c1-6b8c-47ff-9df7-501b633d3b5a"
