      "writtenOn": "2026-08-12T02:58:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "[warning] Line 805: 🟡 When `sender_-\u003esetBitrate(newBR)` returns `0`, `restartSender()` is called but the policy\u0027s applied bitrate has already been advanced to `newBR`. If the restart fails or recreates the sender with a different effective bitrate, future disruptive updates may be coalesced against the wrong baseline. Reset the policy after a successful restart from the bitrate actually used to initialize the new sender, or roll it back on restart failure.",
      "revId": "80ed001ed77cf5cf771d621c24b90f98ac74b257",
      "serverId": "1e26b4c1-6b8c-47ff-9df7-501b633d3b5a"
